- That was a joke?

575
00:40:48,946 --> 00:40:50,696
- Yeah.
- That was good!

576
00:40:50,865 --> 00:40:53,155
You're a lot of fun. Try it, Scoob.

577
00:40:53,659 --> 00:40:55,119
Boo.

578
00:40:55,953 --> 00:40:57,663
